      "wiki_content": "The Genius After Hours is a studio album by Ray Charles, released in 1961. It consists entirely of instrumental tracks, recorded between April 30, 1956, and September 12, 1957 (during the sessions for 1957 album The Great Ray Charles). <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Ray+Charles/The+Genius+After+Hours\">Read more on Last.fm</a>. User-contributed text is available under the Creative Commons By-SA License; additional terms may apply.",
      "wiki_summary": "The Genius After Hours is a studio album by Ray Charles, released in 1961. It consists entirely of instrumental tracks, recorded between April 30, 1956, and September 12, 1957 (during the sessions for 1957 album The Great Ray Charles). <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Ray+Charles/The+Genius+After+Hours\">Read more on Last.fm</a>."
